==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
{{der|en|la|tuberculum}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} A round nodule, small eminence, or warty outgrowth, especially those found on [[bone]]s for the attachment of a [[muscle]] or [[ligament]] or small elevations on the surface of a tooth.
# {{lb|en|botany}} A small rounded wartlike protuberance of the roots of some [[leguminous]] plants; the lip of certain [[orchid]]s, [[cactus|cacti]].
# {{lb|en|pathology}} A small rounded nodule forming the characteristic [[lesion]] of [[tuberculosis]].

